<title>SWEDEN: SWEDEN EXPECTS BALANCED BUDGET IN 1998.</title>
<headline>SWEDEN EXPECTS BALANCED BUDGET IN 1998.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish government said on Tuesday in its supplementary budget that it expected to see a balanced budget in 1998 after a deficit of 2.1 percent of Gross Domestic Product in 1997.</p>
</text>
